{title: Rahe Na Rahen Hum}
{artist: Lata Mangeshkar}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
Ra [G]he naa ra [G]he hum,        mehkaa ka [C]rengey..
..banke ka [G]li..banke sa [D]baa,        baagey wa [C]faa [D]me..ae..ae [G]ae
Ra [G]he na ra [G]he hum...        Mausam ko [G]yi ho iss cha [Am]man mein
rang [C]banke rahen [D]gey,        hum khi [C]raah.. [G] ..ma
Chaahat ki [G]khushboo,        yun hi [Am]zulfon se u [C]degi,
khizaa.. [D]ho yaa ba [C]ha.. [G] ..aar,        Yunhi jhum [G]te.. [C]yuhin jhum [G]te..
aur khilte ra [C]hengey..        ..banke ka [G]li..banke sa [D]baa
baagey wa [C]faa [D]me..ae..ae [G]ae,        Ra [G]he na ra [G]he hum....
